  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut carrot and sweet potato into bite-sized chunks. Cut brown onion into thick wedges. Cut beetroot into small chunks.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays. TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62e1f5b82acc17ec740bcc70/step-d6199100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, combine creamy pesto dressing and the water (for the dressing) in a small bowl. Set aside.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a medium bowl, combine lemon pepper seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil. Add haloumi, tossing to coat. Set aside. Little cooks: Take charge by combining the pesto and the water!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62e1f5b82acc17ec740bcc70/step-9d18f7b0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• In a second medium bowl, add couscous, the butter and chicken-style stock powder.\n• Add the boiling water (3/4 cup for 2 people / 1 1/2 cups for 4 people). Stir to combine.\n• Immediately cover with plate and leave for 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62e1f5b82acc17ec740bcc70/step-7f482b4b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Fluff up couscous with a fork.\n• Gently stir roasted veggies through couscous. Cover to keep warm. Little cooks: Under adult supervision, help fluff up the couscous.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62e1f5b82acc17ec740bcc70/step-a64c0d37.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62e1f5b82acc17ec740bcc70/step-522d4b7a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie couscous between bowls. Top with Mediterranean pork.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds. Drizzle with the creamy pesto to serve. Enjoy! Little cooks: Add the finishing touches by sprinkling the almonds and drizzling the pesto on top!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62e1f5b82acc17ec740bcc70/step-7a0cf943.jpg"
    }
  ]
